<div class="seo-static" style="max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 16px;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif"><h1>Vexcura: NCLEX-RN Prep and an Academic EHR for Nursing Schools</h1><p>Vexcura is licensed to nursing schools and facilities, and it's free for their students and instructors. It includes 1,220 cited NCLEX-RN practice questions with rationales, NGN item types, adaptive practice exams, drills, case studies, an ACLS megacode simulator and bedside simulation; an Epic-style academic EHR with My Chart, a MAR, flowsheets and a worklist sidebar; and a clinical instructor workspace with clinical days, attendance, badge sign-in, assignments and curriculum uploads. Every plan includes everything.</p><ul><li><a href="/for-nursing-schools">Vexcura for nursing schools</a></li><li><a href="/for-nursing-schools#pricing">Pricing for schools</a></li><li><a href="/clinical-instructor-tools">Clinical instructor tools</a></li><li><a href="/academic-ehr-for-nursing-students">Academic EHR for nursing students</a></li><li><a href="/nursing-simulation-scenarios">Nursing simulation drills</a></li><li><a href="/nursing-lms-integration">Canvas, Blackboard, D2L and Moodle integration</a></li><li><a href="/free-nclex-practice-exam">Adaptive NCLEX-RN practice exam</a></li><li><a href="/nclex-practice-questions">NCLEX practice questions by category</a></li><li><a href="/nclex-study-guides">Free NCLEX study guides</a></li></ul></div>